  "details": "postinstall (\"node src/postinstall.js\") spawns src/main.js detached in the background. main.js is obfuscated, requires net and child_process.execSync, profiles the host (e.g. wmic queries) and connects over raw TCP to C2 8.152.163.60:8058. Same publisher and C2 as apache-httpclient2 (MAL-2026-20354). Reported to npm on 2026-11-25 and replaced with a security holding package (0.0.1-security) on 2026-11-25.",
